              "id": "07da9dc3-402b-4a45-9e8e-0607c01d5aa0",
              "name": "FAQ",
              "value": "Change meal plan: You can request a new meal plan once every 4 weeks from the app under Plans, then Request Change. Billing date: Subscriptions renew on the same date each month, and receipts are emailed automatically. Cancel subscription: You can cancel any time in Settings, then Subscription. Access continues until the end of the paid period. Refunds: Refunds are available within 7 days of a charge if no plan has been delivered. Weekly check-in: Check-ins are submitted in the app every Sunday, and your coach replies within 2 business days. Reset password: Use Forgot password on the login screen. A reset link arrives by email within a few minutes. App not loading: Update the app, restart your phone, and contact support if it still fails. Change workout days: You can change workout days in Profile, then Training Schedule, and the plan adjusts automatically.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
